            "value" : "Ficha konnte einen Ton in seinem Ordner „Sounds“ nicht lesen oder sichern. Prüfe, ob auf der Festplatte genug Platz ist, und versuche es erneut, und wenn das weiter passiert, melde es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ficha no pudo leer o guardar un sonido en su carpeta Sounds. Revisá que el disco tenga espacio y probá de nuevo y, si sigue pasando, reportalo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ficha non è riuscita a leggere o salvare un audio nella sua cartella Sounds. Controlla che il disco abbia spazio e riprova, e se continua a succedere, segnalalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ficha couldn't read or save an image in its Images folder. Check that the disk has room and try again, and if it keeps happening, report it." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
